description	"Luke Skywalker 

A defensive duelist/support who can share his Force Powers with allies.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- +10% Rate of Fire
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Red/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
-- 8% more Blue Dmg
--- 50 Damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Speed (1)
- Sense (3)
- Emerald Lightning (1) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
^7- ^3*^7Light's Beacon (Shares Force Powers with a ^7targeted/nearby ally)
- +90% Skill Cooldown Timer
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (3)"
